
flowchart TD
    Auth[Login / Register screen] --> Dash

    subgraph NAV["Bottom tab bar - persistent"]
        direction LR
        TabHome[Home]
        TabHistory[History]
        TabExchange[Exchange]
    end

    %% =========================
    %% DASHBOARD
    %% =========================
    TabHome --> Dash

    Dash[Dashboard:
    - Total balance in base currency
    - Base currency
    - Wallet cards
    - Recent transactions
    - View all transactions]

    Dash --> DB[GET /dashboard]

    DB --> DB1[Total Balance:
    totalBalanceBase
    baseCurrency]

    DB --> DB2[Wallet Cards:
    currencyCode
    balance]

    DB --> DB3[Recent Transactions:
    up to 5 transactions
    id
    type
    currencies
    amounts
    status
    createdAt]

    Dash -.->|tap a wallet card| CH[Currency history screen:
    selected currency
    balance
    transaction history]

    CH --> CW[GET /wallets/:currencyCode]
    CW --> CH1[Wallet balance
    transaction count
    createdAt]

    CH -.->|no transactions| CH2[Empty state:
    No transactions yet]

    CH -.->|tap a transaction row| TD[Transaction detail screen]

    %% =========================
    %% HISTORY
    %% =========================
    TabHistory --> H[All transactions screen:
    every currency
    unfiltered by default]

    H --> HT[GET /transactions]

    HT --> H1[Transaction list:
    id
    type
    fromCurrency
    toCurrency
    sourceAmount
    destinationAmount
    status
    createdAt]

    H -.->|no transactions| H2[Empty state:
    No transactions yet]

    H -.->|tap a row| TD

    TD --> TDD[GET /transactions/:id]

    TDD --> TDF[Transaction detail:
    id
    type
    currencies
    sourceAmount
    fee
    rate
    destinationAmount
    status
    createdAt]

    %% =========================
    %% EXCHANGE
    %% =========================
    TabExchange --> EC[All currencies screen:
    available currencies]

    EC --> ECS[GET /currencies]

    ECS --> EC1[Currency list:
    code
    name
    decimalPlaces]

    EC --> ES[Tap currency
    to trade from]

    ES --> ET[Select target currency]

    ET --> EA[Enter amount]

    EA --> RATE[GET /exchange-rates
    ?base=FROM
    &quote=TO]

    RATE --> EA1[Live exchange rate:
    rate
    asOf]

    EA -.->|fetching rate| EAL[Loading:
    Loading exchange rate...]

    EA -.->|rate fetch fails| EA2[Error:
    Unable to load exchange rate
    Try again]

    EA2 -.-> EA

    EA --> EQ[POST /exchange-quotes]

    EQ --> ER[Review and confirm screen:
    From currency
    To currency
    Amount
    Fee
    Rate
    Destination amount
    Quote expiry]

    EQ -.->|insufficient funds| ER1[Error:
    Insufficient balance]

    ER1 --> EA

    ER --> EH{Tap Confirm Exchange}

    EH --> EX[POST /exchanges
    Idempotency-Key]

    EX -->|quote expired| EI[Error:
    Quote expired - refresh]

    EI --> ET

    EX -->|quote already consumed| EIC[Error:
    Quote already consumed]

    EIC --> ET

    EX -->|insufficient balance| ER1

    EX -->|processing| EH1[Loading:
    Processing exchange...]

    EH1 -->|success| ESuc[Success screen:
    Exchange completed successfully]

    EH1 -->|failed| EF[Error:
    Exchange failed]

    EF --> ER

    ESuc --> TabHome